    "sentence_translations": [
      "How fast is finishing a marathon in two hours?",
      "",
      "On October 12th, Eliud Kipchoge from Kenya completed a marathon in Vienna in 1 hour 59 minutes and 40 seconds.",
      "He was the first runner in the world to run a whole marathon in under two hours, breaking the world record.",
      "According to a statement from the organizers of the competition, ..",
      ".. this is almost as difficult as humanity landing on the moon.",
      "In the end, how difficult is it to finish a marathon in less than two hours?",
      "We can calculate a bit.",
      "If you want to run it in 2 hours, then you would need to run at 2 minutes and 50 seconds per kilometer.",
      "If it’s a 400-meter track in a sports field, then you would have to run at 1 minute and 8 seconds per lap, ..",
      ".. and continuously run at this speed for more than 100 laps.",
      "So, can you run this fast?",
